h leaves stale published pty logs for gate 6 || disksyncforkspin -- diff_diskimage_sync spins infinitely in waitpid loop if fork fails || fbctrldisasmnosteps -- fbctrl_port_probe disassembly check passes vacuously on NO-PROMPT sessions || ldrddocblind -- ldrd_pc_prog docstring still says the aligned pair distinguishes a +4 base || wdcphasecount -- altoffset header counts two differential rows; s4 s5 t5 t6 are four || wdczerooracle -- emit()&#x27;s comment falsely says a zero register value would pass; all 36 expected values are nonzero || wdcpadwidth -- altoffset %-56s comment says the width truncates; Python minimum width does not || wdcexemptdate -- altoffset header still says the wiring exemption ends 2026-09-20 || sh4sixguard -- sh4pcic comment says six value guards; the loop has seven || sh4nopexec -- sh4pcic says the NOP 0x0009 is executed; write_arm steps only the store || m88kfrz10eq -- trapfrozen10 blurb still calls the re-route equivalent || m88ktailtext -- TAILHALT glossary requires a stop; the classifier tests the text only || pitlsbiff -- pit rewind comment swaps which byte is the LSB || shxdseed -- sh_halt XD comment says both rows seed both banks; only the store does || pitsendto -- pit send() drops the timeout its step and reg calls pass || xscaldiedor -- xscale exit-1 controls pass on exit 0 or a signal when the text is present || sgixwin7doc -- sgi contract says window-bit collisions are uncaught; xwin7 pre fails on one || sgiverblen -- sgi mutant W comment says the removed catch-all tested len != 8 || panelchildstatus -- Child exit status discarded by wait allows mid-review child crash to pass as answered || ollamathinkburn -- panel_ollama.py wrapper surfaces unverified thinking text as answer when both attempts return empty response || ollamaretrybody -- HTTPError response body dropped on retry in panel_ollama.py discarding usage limit explanation || hygieneuntrackedhelper -- Untracked Python helper without pty.fork affects census counts while bypassed by untracked check || nightlycheckagearg -- Non-numeric MAX_AGE_H causes test syntax error and falls through to ok verdict || nightlycheckheadunknown -- nightly_check.sh accepts HEAD=UNKNOWN as valid attributable commit SHA || adjudcontentcheck -- adjudicate.sh size-only check counts long OLLAMA_SEAT_ERROR or recovered thinking as answered || adjudzeroexit -- adjudicate.sh exits zero when all adjudicators fail and can read stale output files || propagateskipall -- propagate_all_trees.sh skips all trees on new file absent from targets and exits zero || propagateunbuilt -- propagate_all_trees.sh classifies build tree lacking binary as source twin and skips build || batteryrootexport -- nightly_battery.sh unexported ROOT allows child run.sh and lib.sh to fall back to hardcoded default || gitstatuslaunder -- Empty output on failed git status reported as clean working tree in nightly_battery.sh and FIRST-RUN-CHECK.sh || firstrunexitcode -- FIRST-RUN-CHECK.sh prints FAIL count but final echo causes zero exit status || firstruncheckempty -- FIRST-RUN-CHECK.sh divergence check selects nothing on empty source tree and reports pass || firstrundiffsallow -- FIRST-RUN-CHECK.sh divergence check accepts arbitrary mismatched C files and excludes Makefile.skel || hookspathoverride -- install_hooks.sh hardcodes .git/hooks path ignoring git core.hooksPath configuration || hookswritefailure -- install_hooks.sh ignores write and chmod failures and reports success || hookscommentclobber -- install_hooks.sh ownership check matches precommit_check.sh in comment clobbering foreign hooks || inlinediffhunkregex -- inline_diff.sh hunk regex fails to match markdown list items or blank line diffs || probewiringdupquotes -- check_probe_wiring.py duplicate key check regex matches double quotes only missing single-quoted duplicate dict keys || probewiringspacefile -- check_probe_wiring.py git ls-files whitespace split drops filenames containing spaces from domain || diffdiskfflushfsize -- Unflushed image streams can blunt redundant file-size assertions || diffdisksharedworkdir -- Hardcoded shared /tmp/r411c1/work directory has no creation logic and risks concurrent fixture collision || wdcannouncelax -- announcement assertions check first &lt; 1 and other &lt; 1 accepting multiple emissions || wdcaltctlmemleak -- row_orphan_altctl reinitializes third fixture without freeing second buffer leaking 262656 bytes || fbdrainfastcollapse -- Fast-mode freeze retains control 0x80, runs at 2.98 Hz, and a subsequent callback can collapse remaining debt to 1 || hygienemarkassign -- conv_mark checks call to wait(mark=_mark) but never checks that _mark was assigned fresh len(buf) || hygienettinert -- rpt_code filters hash comments only so inert endswith string preserves 2 bad arms pin without arms || hygienenestedtest -- Basename exclusion also exempts nested readiness helpers || hygieneclonepins -- gate 6 expects 74 PTY probes and 43 promptless probes which includes 3 untracked working-tree files || offexemptparse -- Offline exemptions accept impossible dates and extra components || shroundemptyparse -- SuperH result parsing accepts empty score fields in individual checks || hpcc1timeout -- C1 accepts TIMEOUT or signal kill as clean rejection || lunawaitpidzero -- host_status decodes waitpid (0,0) on live child as exit 0 || m88kptyleak -- m88k_rounding_probe leaks 81 master PTY descriptors across sessions || pcc2iplrdvacuity -- IPL wide-read check cannot fail against pre-fix code || ppcptyfdleak -- ppc_rounding_probe session() leaks master pty file descriptor || precommitungraded -- precommit check T treats arbitrary non-grade outcome strings as graded || precommitugstatus -- precommit check T launders python failure in grading check as success || precommitpass2sub -- precommit check F unanchored regex matches &#x27;bypass 2&#x27; as pass-2 commit || receiptprefixlen -- precommit check F allows arbitrarily short 1-char prefix in receipt SHA || identguardgrep -- pr